    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "开始下雨了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "天气预报说的是下午，没想到这么早。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "没关系，我们带伞了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还要继续走原来的路线吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我觉得不用。石头路下雨以后可能有点儿滑。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我们找个室内的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "前面有个可以喝茶的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "正好，坐一会儿等雨小一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "旅行里计划改变很正常。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以前我会觉得没按计划走很可惜。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "现在觉得换一个安排也可以。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "有时候临时变化反而会看到别的东西。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "比如现在可以安静喝茶。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且听听雨声。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这也算旅行的一部分。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "等雨小一点儿再决定下一步。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc038_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，今天继续慢慢来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
